IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
    PROGRAM-ID. OVISSA.

DATA DIVISION.
    WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01 WS-INPUT PIC X(100000).
        01 WS-IDX PIC 9(6).
        01 WS-CHAR PIC X(1).
        01 WS-COUNTER PIC 9(6).
        
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT.

    PERFORM VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(WS-INPUT TRAILING))
        MOVE WS-INPUT(WS-IDX:1) TO WS-CHAR
        IF WS-CHAR = 'u'
        ADD 1 TO WS-COUNTER
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM.

    DISPLAY WS-COUNTER.

STOP RUN.
